WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Kneel with knees hip-width, shins down, hands on the low back.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Lift the chest and press the hips forward.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Reach the hands back toward the heels (or keep them on the back).

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lengthen the neck and breathe; rise slowly to exit.
